# ==============================================================================
# People HRMS — Monorepo Environment Reference
# ==============================================================================
# This repository is organized into two primary workspaces:
#   1. app/api/ — FastAPI backend (Python / PostgreSQL / SQLAlchemy)
#   2. app/web/ — Nuxt 4 frontend (Vue / Nitro / Tailwind CSS)
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quick Setup:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Backend (app/api):
#    Copy `app/api/.env.example` to `app/api/.env` and update your PostgreSQL credentials:
#      cp app/api/.env.example app/api/.env
#
#    Run backend:
#      cd app/api
#      uv sync
#      uv run fastapi dev main.py
#
# 2. Frontend (app/web):
#    Copy `app/web/.env.example` to `app/web/.env`:
#      cp app/web/.env.example app/web/.env
#
#    Run frontend:
#      cd app/web
#      pnpm install
#      pnpm dev
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ground Rules:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - Never commit `.env` or `.env.local` files containing private credentials or keys.
# - Keep `.env.example` files committed with clear documentation and placeholders.
# - Detailed variable references live inside each workspace:
#     • Backend reference:  app/api/.env.example
#     • Frontend reference: app/web/.env.example
